# basePath Chapter2

:: FirstContractOpenCh2
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once

{@Player}	P.A.L. did you get the fab bay cleaned up? 
{@PAL}		The fab bay is in perfect condition, as always. 
{@PAL}		...at least as perfect as it can be on a near obsolete ship.
//{@Player}	You are blaming MY ship for your mess?!


{@Dorian}	Hey! I've got to head out. Good to see you!
{@Player}   I wish everyone else from our old crew felt that way. 
{@Player}	Don't they understand that I need this job so I don't lose the ship? 

// EDIT - KACY 
// Minor changes with Dorian's dialogue. 

$call   LockWikiPage("Basic Conductor") // Basic Conductor is replaced with the full version after first chapter 
$call   LockWikiPage("Basic Insulator") // Basic Insulator is replaced with the full version after first chapter 
$call   UnlockWikiPage("Conductor")
$call   UnlockWikiPage("Insulator")

::AfterResearchCh2 

@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once
{@Player}   P.A.L., turns out that material wasn't an insulator. It's a semiconductor.
{@PAL}      Exactly! Great work, Captain.
{@Player}   Exactly? You verified it as an insulator before.
{@PAL}      You're absolutely right. Your research clearly shows that it's a semiconductor.
{@Player}   But you seemed pretty sure before.
{@PAL}      Absolutely! And now we have the correct answer.
{@Player}   ...It's weird how you just keep agreeing with me.


::BeforeSupplyChainCh2
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene
@once

//introduce the idea of the refining station. pick up at wayward and refine at frosch
{@Player}   Hmmm... looks like I'll need a semiconductor material...
{@Player}   I don't see any in this sector.
{@PAL}      You can make one!
{@PAL}      You can get silicon dioxide at Frosch and have the haulers take it to a refinery.
{@Player}   A two step process? That sounds pricey.

//cut ?conversation with Taryn and Ovill arguing over who gets to source for Locke. This isn't relevant till level 3 when they can use multiple options.



::AfterSupplyChainCh2
@trigger OnOverarchingLoaded
@when   IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene 
@once


//call coming in from Quinn
{@Quinn}    Why do you have Frontier's bots on the Constantine?
{@Player}   Oh, hey Quinn. Well... ship repairs put me in some serious debt. 
{@Player}	Can't afford my old crew, so I need the bots to run Fabrication.
{@Quinn}    Oooof. Bad luck. Watch out Cowboy. Frontier builds those bots cheap. 
{@Quinn}		Always needing new parts.
//end call



::AfterFabricationCh2 
@trigger OnOverarchingLoaded
@when   IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply), IsSolutionFoundFor(Fabrication)
@cutscene 
@once


{@PAL}      Quinn is incorrect in her assessment of Frontier Robotics. 
{@PAL}		We have a stellar reputation! 
{@Player}	Were you listening to my call? 
